<title>SINGAPORE: Lim Kah 1st half net profit up 82.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Lim Kah 1st half net profit up 82.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million of Singapore $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   9.02  vs     4.95</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		6.12  vs     3.36</p>
<p>    Fully diluted			5.19  vs     2.94</p>
<p>    Turnover			    84.44  vs    50.94</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  11.97  vs     6.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    13.05  vs     8.01</p>
<p>    Tax				    3.99   vs    3.07</p>
<p>Minority (loss)		    0.05   vs    nil</p>
<p>Note - Full name Lim Kah Ngam Ltd.</p>
</text>
